        "answer_image": null,
        "explanation": "<p>According to Le Chatelier's Principle, increasing the pressure shifts the equilibrium toward the side with fewer moles of gas. Here, the forward reaction (2 moles of $NH_3$) is favored over the reverse (4 moles of $N_2$ and $H_2$).</p>",
        "reference_passage": null,
        "novel": null,
